<para id="X39400000QZ021C" category="C" type-id="302Z2" name-id="066NI-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0016/18</dtccode>
<dtcname>VVT Sensor (Out of Range)</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0018/18</dtccode>
<dtcname>VVT Sensor 2 (Out of Range)</dtcname>
<subpara id="X39400000QZ021C_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D2N00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>This VVT system performs advance and retard control of the intake and exhaust camshafts to provide the optimal valve timing for each driving condition. This control is performed based on conditions such as intake air volume, throttle position and engine coolant temperature. Based on the signals from these sensors, the engine control computer adjusts the oil control valves; as a result, the relative position of the camshafts is optimized, improving fuel economy, output and emission performance. The engine control computer also detects the actual valve timing using the signal from the camshaft position sensor and performs feedback control to achieve the target valve timing.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A145886J14" width="7.106578999in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="0.8675236     in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="3.015857     in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="3.263539     in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Others</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0016/18</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0018/18</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine running</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Valve timing deviation (valve timing cannot be controlled to target)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>18 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>2 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Mechanical system malfunction (timing chain jumped teeth, chain stretched)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>VVT signal (phase deviation)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Camshaft Timing Oil Control Valve Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
